{"id": 992568, "slug": "big-trouble-in-little-chimney", "name": "Big Trouble in Little Chimney", "name_original": "Big Trouble in Little Chimney", "description": "<p>Krampus is Coming! Grab your shotgun, finish your hot punch and don't forget your mission: Save the Christmas! Big Trouble in Little Chimney is highly-addictive and fast paced arena bullet-hell shooter.</p><p>Survive endless hordes of creatures lurk from the dark chimney and save the Christmas!</p><p><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>Simple controls and pure arcade action</p></li><li><p>Quick 10 minute play sessions </p></li><li><p>Infinite replayability as you chase ever higher scores!</p></li><li><p>Over 10 brutal enemy types like: Turkey, Gingerbread man, or Nutcracker</p></li><li><p>Plenty of guns for fun: Shotgun, SMG or awesome Flamethrower for all BBQ lovers!</p></li><li><p>Collect jingle bells and gain new upgrades as you progress</p></li><li><p>Unlock New Weapons and special abilities in the Santa's Store</p></li><li><p>2 Game modes: Krampus is coming, Giftpocalypse</p></li><li><p>Handcrafted pixel graphics created with love</p></li><li><p>Great music by Kevin MacLeod</p></li><li><p>Full Xbox 360 controller support</p></li><li><p>Includes Steam Achievements and small green Elves!</p></li></ul><p><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains a lot of Turkeys and elements of PIXEL violence :O</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-11-11", "tba": false, "updated": "2024-11-15T08:31:02", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/59b/59b02445f6cd0b74efaab33d20fdd3de.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/3e7/3e79ebc942d2a89e62dc174a62431467.jpg", "website": "http://www.fobti-interactive.com", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 11, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent